      "type": "compare",
      "q": "Compare the three ATP-regenerating systems by speed and capacity.",
      "a": "Phosphocreatine is fastest with the smallest capacity, glycolysis is fast and limited, oxidative phosphorylation is slowest with practically unlimited capacity.",
